        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Separate two matters that the speaker treats as different. Liking something does not automatically mean agreeing to it.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "喜欢是喜欢，同意是同意。",
                "pinyin": "xǐhuan shì xǐhuan ， tóngyì shì tóngyì 。",
